& [ReusableMechanicMap]
  + [C01_consumption] shared-attention compare-and-set sequence and head-digest checks demonstrate stale-write refusal; NHC-04 carries only unconsumed authorization and has no consumption transition ledger
  + [C02_ownership] NHC-04 has distinct process model stream and quarantine references while activation transactions distinguish recovery owner from activation authority; neither establishes runtime ownership lease transfer or liveness
  + [C03_observation] workspace admission hashes a pinned executable before direct spawn and the B1 broker validates closed specs; both are domain-specific and do not observe the NHC-04 target
  + [C04_process] Windows containment demonstrates suspended creation exact inherited-handle list job assignment before resume kill-on-close bounded descendants and terminal process accounting; its private permit remains activation-locked and was not invoked
  + [C05_streams] workspace observation and Windows containment demonstrate concurrent bounded stdout stderr draining stdin closure truncation and observed-byte accounting; neither issues durable stream-owner identities acknowledgements or recovery receipts
  + [C06_cancellation] workspace timeout kills and waits for one child while Windows containment terminates a whole job; neither supplies the NHC-05 request acknowledgement grace escalation causal receipt or ambiguity state machine
  + [C07_restart_loss] volatile MCP custody explicitly loses every entry on restart and refuses old handles; checkpoint custody resumes exact effectless traces but claims no persistence authentication producer truth or physical recovery
  + [C08_recovery] succeeding-SOP activation and fixture rollback demonstrate distinct recovery-owner rollback target generation trigger quarantine and partial-effect forms; their source registry domain cannot be imported as nested-session authority
  + [C09_effect_broker] the B1 production broker demonstrates an unforgeable crate-private execution permit and an activation lock that currently always refuses; it is a sibling contract not a general NHC-05 capability

& [CrossDomainExclusions]
  + shared-attention ledger and temporal tandem release barriers may later coordinate NHC-06 jobs but do not prove process custody model state stream ownership or executor completion
  + lifecycle and checkpoint custody use the word custody for immutable value retention and cannot be relabeled as operating-system custody
  + fixture rollback performs separately governed filesystem effects in a disposable SOP registry domain and is not a reusable physical implementation commission
  + Windows containment is inspected source only in this audit; no permit child process model provider stream cancellation cleanup or effect was run

